# The Bugsink addresses (DSNs) the Google-free Android build (scripts/android-foss-build.sh, the F-Droid recipe) reports to,
# once the user turns error reports on (REL-LOG-06; off until then). Committed because F-Droid builds from source with no
# secrets; a DSN is public anyway: every shipped APK carries it, and the ingest host only accepts report envelopes.
# One Bugsink project per app: badger-mobile (2), badger-tv (3), parrot-mobile (16).
